      "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:58:36.039Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We’re excited to introduce a new update to <strong>POSNext</strong>, bringing more flexibility at checkout, stronger payment workflows, and clearer financial visibility for store owners and accountants.</p>\n<p>This release targets real retail challenges, including promotions, partial payments, customer credit handling, and invoice tracking — all wrapped in a clean, fast, and intuitive POS interface.</p>\n<p>Every option can be managed from the Settings page in the sidebar, giving you fast access to all configurations.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-485174-h-1-advanced-discount-engine-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-h-1-advanced-discount-engine-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/star.png?v=15\" title=\":star:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":star:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>1. Advanced Discount Engine</strong></h3>\n<p>Now you can manage discounts in two powerful ways:</p>\n<h4><a name=\"p-485174-item-level-discount-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-item-level-discount-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Item-Level Discount</strong></h4>\n<p>Apply a discount directly on any item — by percentage or fixed amount.<br>\nPerfect for promotions, special customers, or manager approval.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/7/67843fc6585bbdc3127ca01fdd7ad20689363566.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/67843fc6585bbdc3127ca01fdd7ad20689363566\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/67843fc6585bbdc3127ca01fdd7ad20689363566_2_369x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eLKwm8UH8tGvOZkYnpN6JszzL7w\" width=\"369\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/67843fc6585bbdc3127ca01fdd7ad20689363566_2_369x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/67843fc6585bbdc3127ca01fdd7ad20689363566_2_553x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/7/67843fc6585bbdc3127ca01fdd7ad20689363566.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">558×756 39.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h4><a name=\"p-485174-invoice-level-discount-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-invoice-level-discount-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Invoice-Level Discount</strong></h4>\n<p>Apply a discount to the entire order with one click.<br>\nFast, consistent, and no manual price edits.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/0/f052cb43efce1a9a1df9dc8c9dee0ae6423df31f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f052cb43efce1a9a1df9dc8c9dee0ae6423df31f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/0/f052cb43efce1a9a1df9dc8c9dee0ae6423df31f_2_493x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yhZYEnsIAPiJipfoVeQkUlkZm4n\" width=\"493\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/0/f052cb43efce1a9a1df9dc8c9dee0ae6423df31f_2_493x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/0/f052cb43efce1a9a1df9dc8c9dee0ae6423df31f_2_739x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/0/f052cb43efce1a9a1df9dc8c9dee0ae6423df31f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">837×848 47.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-485174-h-2-flexible-payment-methods-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-h-2-flexible-payment-methods-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/star.png?v=15\" title=\":star:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":star:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>2. Flexible Payment Methods</strong></h3>\n<p>Different customers pay differently — now POSNext supports:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Full Payment</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/e/fe1ab8f4941971b534357e5c553bcc46ed717f45.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fe1ab8f4941971b534357e5c553bcc46ed717f45\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/e/fe1ab8f4941971b534357e5c553bcc46ed717f45_2_467x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"AfUwRT1CTytm9sXa8QbWQLn7AKV\" width=\"467\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/e/fe1ab8f4941971b534357e5c553bcc46ed717f45_2_467x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/e/fe1ab8f4941971b534357e5c553bcc46ed717f45_2_700x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/e/fe1ab8f4941971b534357e5c553bcc46ed717f45.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8FAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">830×888 48.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Partial Payment</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/7/673bf9b2cc92649338e817543b67cc7dcb630991.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/673bf9b2cc92649338e817543b67cc7dcb630991\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/673bf9b2cc92649338e817543b67cc7dcb630991_2_462x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eJfFV1vilZAxsZghpqAPnUufgDT\" width=\"462\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/673bf9b2cc92649338e817543b67cc7dcb630991_2_462x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/673bf9b2cc92649338e817543b67cc7dcb630991_2_693x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/7/673bf9b2cc92649338e817543b67cc7dcb630991.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F9FB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">830×898 48.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Pay using Customer Credit</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/8/18256274b95ae5c3af2d5d4e0720bc1745a9557a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/18256274b95ae5c3af2d5d4e0720bc1745a9557a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/8/18256274b95ae5c3af2d5d4e0720bc1745a9557a_2_506x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3rByr0uwW3RuI6UeFWTYEzOEuXU\" width=\"506\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/8/18256274b95ae5c3af2d5d4e0720bc1745a9557a_2_506x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/8/18256274b95ae5c3af2d5d4e0720bc1745a9557a_2_759x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/8/18256274b95ae5c3af2d5d4e0720bc1745a9557a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">836×825 53.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Cashiers can immediately view the customer’s available credit and settle the order accordingly.</p>\n<p>This gives businesses more control over credit sales, loyalty programs, and installment-friendly workflows.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-485174-h-3-clear-invoice-status-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-h-3-clear-invoice-status-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/star.png?v=15\" title=\":star:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":star:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>3. Clear Invoice Status</strong></h3>\n<p>Every invoice now displays its status in real time:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Fully Paid<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Partially Paid<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Unpaid</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/0/005fe395dacc72eba4b108dbc865a49689ba3bca.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/005fe395dacc72eba4b108dbc865a49689ba3bca\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/0/005fe395dacc72eba4b108dbc865a49689ba3bca_2_690x326.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3jrm9oeZhm64CtAjvWtz34OkRk\" width=\"690\" height=\"326\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/0/005fe395dacc72eba4b108dbc865a49689ba3bca_2_690x326.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/0/005fe395dacc72eba4b108dbc865a49689ba3bca_2_1035x489.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/0/005fe395dacc72eba4b108dbc865a49689ba3bca_2_1380x652.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F7F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1822×861 76.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This helps cashiers and managers identify pending payments instantly.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-485174-h-4-smart-filtering-in-invoice-history-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-h-4-smart-filtering-in-invoice-history-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/star.png?v=15\" title=\":star:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":star:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>4. Smart Filtering in Invoice History</strong></h3>\n<p>No more scrolling or searching manually.</p>\n<p>Filter invoices by:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Paid / Partially Paid / Unpaid</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Date range</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Customer</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Invoice totals</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And more…</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/2/72b8c749e9483f41fd85581e83b9a01ef4b756d1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/72b8c749e9483f41fd85581e83b9a01ef4b756d1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/2/72b8c749e9483f41fd85581e83b9a01ef4b756d1_2_690x234.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gmSjHacmJCWmCfyovnhJwiCMuSB\" width=\"690\" height=\"234\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/2/72b8c749e9483f41fd85581e83b9a01ef4b756d1_2_690x234.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/2/72b8c749e9483f41fd85581e83b9a01ef4b756d1_2_1035x351.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/2/72b8c749e9483f41fd85581e83b9a01ef4b756d1_2_1380x468.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1812×617 39.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This makes end-of-day reporting, reconciliation, and account follow-ups much easier.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-485174-why-this-release-matters-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-why-this-release-matters-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Why this release matters</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Faster and cleaner checkout<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Accurate discount control<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Better credit and partial payment flows<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Clear invoice visibility<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Ready for real-world retail needs</p>\n<p>POSNext continues to improve based on real store feedback — and we love building features that actually solve business pain points.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-485174-open-source-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485174-open-source-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Open Source</strong></h2>\n<p>POSNext is an open-source project and welcomes contributions from the community.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/link.png?v=15\" title=\":link:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":link:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>GitHub Repository:</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext</a></p>\n<p>You’re welcome to star the repo, report issues, submit PRs, or share your ideas.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Drop your suggestions below — we’re building POSNext with the community.</p>",
